WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.182
Ben tucked the two paintings under his arm.

2
00:00:04.183 --> 00:00:07.517
"Follow me!" he said, grabbing Pixel's arm.

3
00:00:07.518 --> 00:00:13.750
Together the ghosts floated smoothly through a wall of the darkroom and out into the classroom.

4
00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:17.772
Then they glided through another door into the hallway.

5
00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:23.179
"Whoa! This is what I call floating," Pixel exclaimed.

6
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.672
"We haven't bumped into anything or knocked stuff over!"

7
00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:35.115
"You'll get better soon," Ben promised him. "I'll help you."

8
00:00:35.116 --> 00:00:42.317
The two ghosts zipped downstairs and quickly hung up the two missing paintings.

9
00:00:42.318 --> 00:00:50.139
Then they got the third one from the newspaper office and hung it up too. After

10
00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:58.084
they'd picked out some good photos for the newspaper article, they flew to the gym. The

11
00:00:58.085 --> 00:01:04.490
witches were still flying around, frantically putting the finishing touches on the flying painting. When

12
00:01:04.491 --> 00:01:09.815
Ben went up close, he could see the fresh paint in several places. But

13
00:01:09.816 --> 00:01:17.075
the paint would dry, and from a distance, nobody would notice a thing. "It

14
00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:20.429
looks great, Winnie," Ben said. "Thanks!"

15
00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:26.073
Her green eyes glowed with relief. "I think so too." Only

16
00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:34.108
Mr. Freaky still looked worried as he wrung his hands and blew his noses. "Hurry

17
00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:42.097
up, witches! Leonardo da Creepy will be here in fifteen minutes!" ***

18
00:01:42.098 --> 00:01:49.696
At seven o'clock Ben went into the main lobby, where Mr. Freaky and Ms. Van Ghoul were waiting nervously.

19
00:01:49.697 --> 00:01:55.156
A few minutes later, a sleek black car pulled up in front of the school.

20
00:01:55.157 --> 00:02:01.124
The famous artist emerged, carrying a large painting wrapped in brown paper.

21
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:06.450
Ms. Van Ghoul and Mr. Freaky hurried to greet him.

22
00:02:06.451 --> 00:02:11.076
"Welcome back, and please come with us," Ms. Van Ghoul said.

23
00:02:11.077 --> 00:02:13.650
"We're holding the ceremony in the gym.

24
00:02:13.651 --> 00:02:18.006
Everyone is very excited to see your new painting."

25
00:02:18.007 --> 00:02:22.640
"It's one of my best," Mr. da Creepy boasted. "It

26
00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:28.960
might be even better than Moaning Lisa ."

27
00:02:28.961 --> 00:02:34.353
"Wow," Ben thought. "It must be a spectacular painting."

28
00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:39.527
"And don't worry about all the commotion," Mr. Freaky went on.

29
00:02:39.528 --> 00:02:43.214
"If you need quiet time, you can use the newspaper office.

30
00:02:43.215 --> 00:02:48.263
It's very quiet in there."

31
00:02:48.264 --> 00:02:53.531
They entered the gym, which was crowded now with students and a news crew.

32
00:02:53.532 --> 00:03:00.254
A camerawoman was shooting the flying painting as a reporter stood in front of it with a microphone.

33
00:03:00.255 --> 00:03:03.183
Ben pointed them out to Winnie.

34
00:03:03.184 --> 00:03:06.905
"Look! Your flying painting is going to be on TV!"

35
00:03:06.906 --> 00:03:13.071
"Thanks, but I bet they're just killing time until Mr. da Creepy unveils his new painting."

36
00:03:13.072 --> 00:03:14.647
Ben shook his head.

37
00:03:14.648 --> 00:03:17.195
"Nope. Everybody loves that painting.

38
00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.294
It's the best work of art in the whole school."

39
00:03:20.295 --> 00:03:26.183
Winnie grinned slyly. "Better than Moving Inspiration

40
00:03:26.184 --> 00:03:30.349
?" "Hmm." Ben pretended to think for a

41
00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:36.643
minute. "Yep! Much, much, much

42
00:03:36.644 --> 00:03:58.745
better!" *** At last the lights dimmed, and the Boneyard Brass Band played a couple

43
00:03:58.746 --> 00:04:08.607
of songs. Then Mr. Freaky and Ms. Van Ghoul each gave a long speech about Art Week and how great everything had

44
00:04:08.608 --> 00:04:12.025
turned out. At last it was Leonardo da Creepy's

45
00:04:12.026 --> 00:04:17.625
turn. Everyone clapped as the artist stepped up to the

46
00:04:17.626 --> 00:04:24.100
microphone. His painting stood on a big easel next to the podium, still wrapped in brown

47
00:04:24.101 --> 00:04:28.870
paper. Winnie gripped Ben's hand. "This is so

48
00:04:28.871 --> 00:04:35.388
exciting!" Ben nodded, jotting down a few notes for his newspaper story. "It sure

49
00:04:35.389 --> 00:04:38.035
is." Leonardo da Creepy cleared his

50
00:04:38.036 --> 00:04:43.878
throat. "Good evening, students and members of the Monster Academy

51
00:04:43.879 --> 00:04:53.684
community. I'm very proud to be here to present a gift to this wonderful, artistic school—it's my latest

52
00:04:53.685 --> 00:04:58.010
masterpiece." Several monsters

53
00:04:58.011 --> 00:05:01.176
cheered. "Let's see it!" cried a

54
00:05:01.177 --> 00:05:06.755
skeleton. "It sounds like you're all very eager to get to it," Mr. da Creepy said with a

55
00:05:06.756 --> 00:05:12.384
smile. "So, with no further ado . . .

56
00:05:12.385 --> 00:05:14.573
" He leaned closer to the

57
00:05:14.582 --> 00:05:17.507
painting. "I'll present my latest work of

58
00:05:17.508 --> 00:05:24.552
art." Ms. Van Ghoul hurried forward, and together they removed the brown paper

59
00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:31.267
wrapping. A gasp rippled through the audience as the covering fell

60
00:05:31.268 --> 00:05:34.732
away. Ben looked at Winnie, and Winnie looked back at

61
00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:40.314
Ben. They both burst out laughing at the same

62
00:05:40.315 --> 00:05:44.795
time. "It's a portrait of Mr. Freaky!" Ben

63
